  "description": "Plane Flight Simulator lets you experience the thrill of flying like never before. Step into the pilot’s seat with a single goal: master the skies and grow your aviation career from humble beginnings to global recognition. Every flight challenges your skills, strategy, and courage as you explore the world from above.\n\nKey Features:\n• Fleet Management: Purchase and upgrade aircraft — from light private planes to powerful passenger jets — improving speed, maneuverability, and reliability.\n• Infrastructure Development: Expand hangars, improve your airbase, and optimize conditions for maintaining your fleet.\n• Realistic Weather Conditions: Navigate wind, rain, fog, and thunderstorms, adapting to every challenge with precision.\n• Day and Night Cycle: Fly at sunrise, bright daylight, sunset, or under the stars for truly immersive experiences.\n• Freedom of Exploration: Unlock dozens of airports worldwide, discover new routes, and test your reflexes, endurance, and piloting skills.\n\nPlane Flight Simulator is more than just flying — it’s a journey of ambition, courage, and discipline. Fly, upgrade, explore, and become a true king of the skies.",
